{"id": "dish-sf-contingency", "title": "DISH SF: first contract set $4,103 under the Board line, then $25.4M", "seconds": 130.2, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "tempo": 1.047, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "7ecedb8f2f38eeab", "words": 357, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "July 1, 2025.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 1.98, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "Contract 1000035491, July 1, 2025", "text": "shall not exceed ... $9,995,897", "mark": "$9,995,897"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.73, 1.03]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City’s homelessness department signs DISH SF for one year. The limit?", "t0": 2.1, "t1": 6.94, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "Contract 1000035491, July 1, 2025", "text": "shall not exceed ... $9,995,897", "mark": "$9,995,897"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.48, 1.05, 1.59, 2.0, 2.33, 2.61, 2.85, 3.08, 3.3, 4.09, 4.29]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "amount"], "text": "9,995,897 dollars.", "t0": 6.94, "t1": 8.5, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$9,995,897", "label": "one-year contract, July 1, 2025"}, "emph": ["9,995,897"], "wt": [0.04, 0.38, 0.63, 0.97]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "title"], "text": "4,103 dollars under 10 million, where the Board of Supervisors must vote.", "t0": 9.02, "t1": 13.93, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "must vote at $10M"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "$4,103 under the line"}, "emph": ["4,103"], "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.82, 1.04, 1.36, 1.61, 2.02, 2.28, 2.54, 2.94, 3.12, 3.21, 3.44, 3.53, 4.26, 4.53]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 14.05, "t1": 15.71, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.34, 0.43, 0.8, 0.99, 1.07]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "DISH isn’t new. Since 2006, it has run City-leased hotels for formerly homeless adults.", "t0": 15.93, "t1": 22.31, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Tides Center", "sub": "fiscal sponsor, 2006 to June 2025"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "DISH SF", "sub": "independent since July 1, 2025"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Six master-leased hotels", "sub": "450 supportive-housing units"}], "kicker": "Who DISH is"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.81, 1.75, 2.09, 2.29, 2.69, 3.06, 3.19, 3.34, 3.59, 4.2, 4.75, 4.94, 5.4, 5.81]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]", "established[11]"], "text": "Its fiscal sponsor, Tides Center, held its contracts and employed its staff.", "t0": 22.43, "t1": 27.1, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Tides Center", "sub": "fiscal sponsor, 2006 to June 2025"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "DISH SF", "sub": "independent since July 1, 2025"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Six master-leased hotels", "sub": "450 supportive-housing units"}], "kicker": "Who DISH is"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.67, 1.27, 1.66, 2.15, 2.42, 2.6, 3.29, 3.45, 3.91, 4.1]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In July 2025, DISH went out on its own.", "t0": 27.22, "t1": 30.04, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Tides Center", "sub": "fiscal sponsor, 2006 to June 2025"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "DISH SF", "sub": "independent since July 1, 2025"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Six master-leased hotels", "sub": "450 supportive-housing units"}], "kicker": "Who DISH is"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.54, 0.83, 1.5, 1.79, 2.0, 2.19, 2.33, 2.53]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "That day, the department hired the new DISH SF for the same six buildings. No bidding.", "t0": 30.16, "t1": 35.55, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Same six buildings, 450 units", "sub": "no bidding, under Administrative Code Chapter 21B"}, "emph": ["No bidding"], "wt": [0.0, 0.27, 0.51, 0.62, 1.14, 1.5, 1.62, 1.83, 2.18, 2.45, 2.7, 2.87, 2.98, 3.29, 3.61, 4.65, 4.93]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[8]", "story[4]", "trajectory"], "text": "Its first year, DISH SF got 12.5 million dollars.", "t0": 35.67, "t1": 39.32, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Tides Center, FY2025", "$16.2 million"], "b": ["DISH SF, FY2026", "$12.5 million"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.55, 0.84, 1.16, 1.39, 1.59, 1.78, 2.12, 2.41, 2.72, 3.08]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[8]", "story[4]", "trajectory"], "text": "That money moved over from Tides, paid 16.2 million the year before.", "t0": 39.44, "t1": 43.7, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Tides Center, FY2025", "$16.2 million"], "b": ["DISH SF, FY2026", "$12.5 million"]}, "emph": ["moved over"], "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.51, 0.79, 1.02, 1.24, 1.76, 2.04, 2.58, 2.86, 3.08, 3.46, 3.55, 3.74]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "So how did the total land just under?", "t0": 43.92, "t1": 46.12, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The program budget", "kicker": "The first lead", "chip": "$9,221,307"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.3, 0.43, 0.54, 0.85, 1.12, 1.38]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Start with the budget: 9,221,307 dollars.", "t0": 46.12, "t1": 49.26, "shot": "b8x", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "The program budget", "kicker": "The first lead", "chip": "$9,221,307"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.32, 0.43, 0.52, 1.08, 1.45, 1.7, 1.98, 2.19, 2.55]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[4]", "story[2]"], "text": "Add a contingency, a cushion for overruns. The standard is 15 percent. The total?", "t0": 49.38, "t1": 55.45, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Add a cushion", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "the department’s standard contingency: 15%"}, "emph": ["15 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.3, 1.26, 1.39, 1.77, 1.97, 3.16, 3.35, 3.82, 3.96, 4.44, 5.03, 5.21]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["story[2]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "About 10.6 million.", "t0": 55.45, "t1": 57.21, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10.6 million", "label": "with the standard 15% contingency", "sub": "over the line: a Board vote"}, "emph": ["About"], "wt": [0.04, 0.36, 0.64, 0.94, 1.25]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Over the line. Instead, the cushion was 774,590 dollars:", "t0": 57.73, "t1": 64.35, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the standard", "15%"], "b": ["DISH SF’s first contract", "$774,590 (about 8.4%)"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.41, 1.42, 1.92, 2.03, 2.43, 2.62, 2.97, 3.38, 4.02, 4.52, 4.82, 5.17, 5.54]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "about 8.4 percent.", "t0": 64.35, "t1": 66.1, "shot": "b11x", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["the standard", "15%"], "b": ["DISH SF’s first contract", "$774,590 (about 8.4%)"]}, "emph": ["8.4 percent"], "wt": [0.04, 0.39, 0.64, 0.94, 1.22]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why"], "text": "It’s the one number the department picks freely. And it kept the total under.", "t0": 66.22, "t1": 70.58, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The one number the department chooses freely is the one that kept the total under the line."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.42, 0.64, 0.97, 1.08, 1.59, 1.9, 2.83, 3.08, 3.17, 3.43, 3.54, 3.92]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "span", "ref": ["established[6]", "story[3]"], "text": "Eleven months later, the Board raised the ceiling. To what?", "t0": 70.8, "t1": 74.35, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-07-01", "to": "2026-06-05", "days": "339", "fromLab": "signed", "toLab": "Resolution 321-26", "kicker": "The second lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.77, 1.12, 1.23, 1.58, 1.91, 2.02, 2.96, 3.19]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "25.4 million dollars.", "t0": 74.35, "t1": 76.59, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$25,361,109", "label": "after adding $15,365,212"}, "emph": ["25.4"], "wt": [0.04, 0.71, 0.99, 1.27, 1.65]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "And this time, the cushion was 20 percent.", "t0": 77.11, "t1": 79.7, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["first contract’s cushion", "about 8.4%"], "b": ["the 2026 amendment", "20%"]}, "emph": ["20 percent"], "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.93, 1.1, 1.5, 1.69, 2.04]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "story[3]"], "text": "The Board’s analyst noted the first amount, recommended approval, and said nothing more.", "t0": 79.82, "t1": 84.36, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Recommended approval", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "Budget and Legislative Analyst, May 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.49, 0.99, 1.25, 1.36, 1.67, 2.19, 2.74, 3.35, 3.57, 3.83, 4.17]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "DISH SF’s second deal, for 1321 Mission Street?", "t0": 84.58, "t1": 88.9, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "1321 Mission Street", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "contract 1000035759, to Feb 16, 2028", "chip": "$9,980,308.65"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.87, 1.26, 1.67, 1.87, 2.36, 2.88, 3.27]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "19,691 dollars under the line.", "t0": 88.9, "t1": 92.13, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "1321 Mission Street", "kicker": "The third lead", "sub": "contract 1000035759, to Feb 16, 2028", "chip": "$9,980,308.65"}, "emph": ["19,691"], "wt": [0.04, 0.52, 0.95, 1.18, 1.49, 2.03, 2.46, 2.7, 2.81]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[3]", "suspicious[2].why"], "text": "It seems carried over from Tides. How that amount was set isn’t known.", "t0": 92.25, "t1": 96.53, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["How the $9,980,308.65 for 1321 Mission was set"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.46, 0.81, 1.06, 1.28, 2.31, 2.57, 2.78, 3.09, 3.23, 3.57, 3.85]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[9]", "next[3]"], "text": "The building is the City’s own.", "t0": 96.65, "t1": 98.43, "shot": "b18a", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pr1", "kicker": "Recorder’s index · 1321 Mission Street, owned by the City", "text": "2 Fire Department orders of abatement: 2025-04-16 (the City as owner) and 2026-06-22 (another party); no release listed. 1 water lien, 2025-05-14, cancelled 2025-06-20 as filed in error", "mark": "Fire Department"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.58, 0.75, 0.86, 1.28]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[9]", "next[3]"], "text": "Since 2025 it has drawn two Fire Department orders, often lifted within months.", "t0": 98.43, "t1": 103.44, "shot": "b18a", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "pr1", "kicker": "Recorder’s index · 1321 Mission Street, owned by the City", "text": "2 Fire Department orders of abatement: 2025-04-16 (the City as owner) and 2026-06-22 (another party); no release listed. 1 water lien, 2025-05-14, cancelled 2025-06-20 as filed in error", "mark": "Fire Department"}, "emph": ["two Fire Department orders"], "wt": [0.04, 0.38, 0.71, 1.34, 1.43, 1.54, 1.83, 2.09, 2.39, 2.87, 3.43, 3.81, 4.17, 4.51]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Nothing shows anyone chose 8.4 percent to stay under, or any misuse of money.", "t0": 103.66, "t1": 108.64, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That anyone chose 8.4% to stay under $10M", "Any misuse of money by DISH SF or Tides Center"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.82, 1.21, 1.59, 1.84, 2.14, 2.39, 2.77, 2.87, 3.2, 3.62, 3.83, 4.02, 4.48, 4.59]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "DISH met 5 of 7 goals.", "t0": 108.76, "t1": 110.53, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["5", "of", "7"], "sub": "objectives met in FY2024-25; no Citywide fiscal monitoring yet"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.54, 0.85, 0.95, 1.26]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "As a new entity, it hasn’t had the City’s fiscal check yet.", "t0": 110.65, "t1": 113.82, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["5", "of", "7"], "sub": "objectives met in FY2024-25; no Citywide fiscal monitoring yet"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.29, 0.48, 0.99, 1.14, 1.48, 1.64, 1.73, 2.07, 2.49, 2.79]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[2]"], "text": "What would settle it? The memo showing who set that cushion, and why.", "t0": 113.94, "t1": 118.99, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The approval memo showing who set the $774,590 contingency, and why"}, {"who": "", "what": "DISH SF’s first audit and fiscal-monitoring letter"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.3, 0.65, 1.45, 1.63, 1.99, 2.37, 2.55, 2.79, 2.98, 3.75, 4.01]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[2]"], "text": "And DISH SF’s first audit.", "t0": 118.99, "t1": 121.09, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The approval memo showing who set the $774,590 contingency, and why"}, {"who": "", "what": "DISH SF’s first audit and fiscal-monitoring letter"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.04, 0.33, 0.74, 1.28, 1.64]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "The amendment passed in June 2026. No authority has criticised the first amount.", "t0": 121.21, "t1": 127.01, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.62, 1.12, 1.31, 1.64, 1.98, 3.44, 3.69, 4.19, 4.34, 4.9, 5.01, 5.31]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.13, "t1": 129.33, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.44, 0.55, 0.61, 1.1, 1.3, 1.39]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "Who DISH is", "lead1": "Lead 1 · the 8.4% cushion", "lead2": "Lead 2 · eleven months later", "lead3": "Lead 3 · 1321 Mission", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}